{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"努力保持坚定\",\"source\":\"这份坚定也可能是他努力想成为的样子，而不再是一个毫无疑问的事实。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿说坚定可能是他努力想成为的样子，屏幕稿却写成他正在努力维持坚定，改变了努力的方向和心理状态。\"},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"离开那些人后才觉得难受\",\"source\":\"想到自己如今已不在那些人身边，只觉得难受。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿是此刻想到自己已经不在那些人身边而难受，屏幕稿却把难受写成离开之后才发生。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"他慢慢明白，自己最舍不得的是从前有人把他当作自己人的日子\",\"source\":\"他慢慢觉得自己最舍不得的，还是从前有人把他当作自己人的日子\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿表达的是逐渐形成的感受，屏幕稿改成逐渐明白的结论，确定性有所增强。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"终于不再原地打转\",\"source\":\"不是问题解决了，而是停滞本身松开了一点。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只是说停滞稍有松动，屏幕稿却写成终于彻底摆脱原地打转，夸大了变化程度。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5896c529-e96b-42db-9675-1342a894df61", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T062948079676Z", "elapsed_seconds": 192.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:33:01.047488+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3db8d08bd38fd37a1a2aa1df2ecbcf454763dd3038ac2cf0d86c4c7fef72106b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applica